 Life Line- ContentsDa", "keywords": ["safety", "fire", "descent", "simulation", "contentsda"], "long_description": "1. Fire situation: There is a fire and you need to escape.\n2. Use the sturdy: Utilize the sturdy to escape.\n3. Install the Stubborn: Install the green hook from the Stubborn box onto the Stubborn support.\n4. Set the speeder: Set the red speeder by overlapping it on the hook.\n5. Move the Stubborn Support: Grab the Stubborn Support and move it off the railing.\n6. Throw the rope: Throw the rope wound on the black reel out the window.\n7. Manipulate the stubbornness belt: Lower the yellow stubbornness belt under your armpits and tighten it.\n8. safe descent: Hold onto the wall with your hands and descend safely without lifting your arms.\n9. successful escape: You have safely escaped and overcome the fire situation.", "short_description": "Understand the critical use of life lines in rescue operations. This experiment teaches the proper techniques for descending from heights safely."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/privacy-policy-en/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/terms-and-conditions-en/", "publisher_name": "ContentsDa Inc", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://training.contentsda.kr/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "331529188132278"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["